{{> menu active="about"}}

<section class="hero is-light">
  <div class="hero-body has-text-centered">
    <p class="title">
      About Historical Placemark
    </p>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Explore and record important historical locations.
    </p>

    <p class="box">
      <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt fa-10x" style="color:darkorange"></i>
      <i class="fas fa-plus fa-4x" style="color:deepskyblue"></i>
      <i class="fas fa-landmark fa-10x" style="color:gold"></i>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container content">

    <p>
      Historical Placemark is a web application that allows users to create collections
      of historical locations and store detailed information about them.
    </p>

    <p>
      Users can add placemarks with a name, description, location coordinates,
      category, and year established. Collections can also include images which
      are stored using Cloudinary.
    </p>

    <p>
      The application is built using Node.js, Hapi, MongoDB, and the Bulma CSS framework.
      It also includes authentication, API endpoints, and an admin dashboard for
      managing system data.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>